<title>FRANCE: Iran buys 200-400,000 tonnes French wheat -traders.</title>
<headline>Iran buys 200-400,000 tonnes French wheat -traders.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Iran has bought between 200,000 and 400,000 tonnes of French soft wheat for shipment from April onwards, grain traders said on Friday.</p>
<p>Traders said selling prices ranged from $139 to $144 per tonne, Fob.</p>
<p>No official confirmation of the deal was immediately available, they said.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
